{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_bridge_runner.py","reason":"Repoint retained reconcile-check runner profile to canonical rebar bridge preview; do not use bridge fsck because fsck findings exit 1 and break runner delivery semantics."},{"path":"src/rebar/_cli/_registry.py","reason":"Remove legacy top-level rebar reconcile route registration."},{"path":"src/rebar/_cli/_parsers/advanced/reconcile.py","reason":"Remove legacy reconcile parser exposure for --mode reconcile-check and --filter-local-ids CLI surface."},{"path":"src/rebar/_cli/help/reconcile.txt","reason":"Remove static/help output for deleted legacy reconcile CLI flags."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/__main__.py","reason":"Delete _run_reconcile_check, its reconcile-check.json writer, the Mode.RECONCILE_CHECK dispatch branch, and CLI-only filter_local_ids handoff."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/request.py","reason":"Remove legacy-route --mode reconcile-check parsing and --filter-local-ids CLI parsing while preserving canonical preview/sync normalization."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/mode.py","reason":"RETAIN Mode.RECONCILE_CHECK plus its _ORDERED and MODE_CAPS entries (load-bearing: _advisory_lock._mode_blocks decodes the pause sentinel via Mode.from_str('reconcile-check')); only revise the docstring wording that describes it as the removed CLI command."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/_preflight.py","reason":"Remove reconcile-check from no-write/preflight logic and documentation after mode removal."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/last_pass.py","reason":"Remove stale .bridge_state/reconcile-check.json reader and reconcile_diagnostics surfacing because no canonical writer remains."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/reconcile_check.py","reason":"Delete orphaned legacy discrepancy-report module once _run_reconcile_check dispatch is removed; delete its dedicated tests too."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/binding_recovery.py","reason":"Remove stale reconcile-check no-write wording; leave behavior unchanged."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/binding_walk.py","reason":"Remove stale reconcile-check no-write wording; leave behavior unchanged."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/fetcher.py","reason":"Remove stale reconcile-check no-write wording; leave behavior unchanged."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/get_rotation.py","reason":"Remove stale reconcile-check read-only wording; leave behavior unchanged."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/load_phase.py","reason":"Remove stale reconcile-check cap-0 wording; leave dry-run persistence gating intact."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/pass_support.py","reason":"Remove stale reconcile-check cap-0 wording; do not remove filter_local_ids engine plumbing."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/reconcile_helpers.py","reason":"Remove stale reconcile-check compatibility wording; leave behavior unchanged."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/ticket_planner.py","reason":"Remove stale reconcile-check no-write wording after MODE_CAPS no longer contains it."},{"path":"src/rebar/schemas/bridge_status.schema.json","reason":"Remove optional reconcile_diagnostics field that was sourced only from the retired reconcile-check.json artifact."},{"path":"src/rebar/types.py","reason":"Remove BridgeStatus reconcile_diagnostics typing tied to retired legacy artifact."},{"path":"src/rebar/_mcp_models.py","reason":"Remove BridgeStatusOut.reconcile_diagnostics so MCP no longer advertises a field with no producer; explicit parity tests must cover this because drift checking permits extra model fields."},{"path":".github/workflows/reconcile-bridge.yml","reason":"Replace manual reconcile-check workflow profile guidance with canonical bridge preview/fsck/status operations while preserving other bridge profiles."},{"path":"Jenkinsfile","reason":"Remove reconcile-check from bridge operation choices or map it to canonical preview consistently with _bridge_runner."},{"path":"scripts/jira-pressure-test/e2e_field_validation_probe.sh","reason":"Replace direct-engine --mode reconcile-check Phase 7 with scoped bridge preview JSON assertions over the probe keys/local ids; stop grepping legacy discrepancy/mismatch prose."},{"path":"scripts/jira-pressure-test/e2e_validation_probe.sh","reason":"Replace direct-engine --mode reconcile-check Phase 5 with scoped bridge preview JSON assertions for zero proposed plan entries for the probe ticket/key; stop grepping legacy 0 discrepancies prose."},{"path":"docs","reason":"Update operator docs to describe preview/fsck/status distributed replacement and remove instructions to invoke reconcile-check."},{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","reason":"Record pre-1.0 removal and canonical migration path."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler","reason":"Remove/update tests for Mode.RECONCILE_CHECK, _run_reconcile_check, and reconcile_check.py; keep dry-run/preview coverage."},{"path":"tests/scripts","reason":"Update bridge-runner profile tests so reconcile-check maps to bridge preview and not bridge fsck."},{"path":"tests/interfaces","reason":"Add held-out CLI-removal, BridgeStatus model/schema absence, and pause-sentinel regression coverage."},{"path":"tests/scripts/test_jira_pressure_probe_preview_assertions_heldout.py","reason":"New held-out oracle proving both pressure probes assert on bridge preview JSON/exit semantics instead of legacy reconcile-check report text."},{"path":"tests/interfaces/facades/test_bridge_programmatic_heldout.py","reason":"Update MCP/library BridgeStatus contract expectations so reconcile_diagnostics is absent from output schema/model."},{"path":"tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_model_schema_drift_heldout.py","reason":"Add explicit guard for BridgeStatusOut not declaring producerless reconcile_diagnostics, since the drift gate does not catch extra permissive model fields."},{"path":"tests/interfaces/facades/test_bridge_status_relocated_store.py","reason":"Replace legacy assertion that bridge_status surfaces reconcile_check summary from configured store with assertion that stale reconcile-check.json is ignored."}]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"FILE_IMPACT","timestamp":1788533780204298001,"uuid":"bba30933-b01a-4fd4-9051-f4801fa84224"}